#: admin/admin.php:229
msgctxt "privacy policy content"
msgid "The Password Protected plugin stores a cookie on successful password login containing a hashed version of the entered password. It does not store any information about the user. The cookie stored is named <code>bid_n_password_protected_auth</code> where <code>n</code> is the blog ID in a multisite network"
msgstr "The Password Protected plugin stores a cookie on successful password login containing a hashed version of the entered password. It does not store any information about the user. The cookie stored is named <code>bid_n_password_protected_auth</code> where <code>n</code> is the blog ID in a multisite network"

